{"id":45094,"ord":64,"n_segments":178,"prev":45093,"next":45095,"doc":{"id":"54270","title":"54270_Doc Cheatham oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Doc Cheatham","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/54270/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=54270"},"chapter":"Teddy Wilson, Cafe Society and bebop","title":"Eddie Heywood's sextet at Cafe Society","category":"band_or_employer","summary":"He stayed with Eddie Heywood Jr.'s sextet at Cafe Society, a long-lasting job all in New York, until 1945.","period":"1943-45","year_from":1943,"year_to":1943,"words":86,"start":[80,9],"end":[81,4],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=54270#s45094","tags":{"places":[{"name":"New York","focus":1,"type":"city"}],"venues":[{"name":"Café Society","focus":1,"city":"New York"}],"bands":[{"name":"Eddie Heywood's sextet","focus":1,"leader":"Eddie Heywood"}]},"people":[{"name":"Eddie Heywood","qid":"Q924783","n":2}],"story":{"theme":36,"theme_name":"Coming to New York: clubs, jams, and making it","community":73,"community_name":"Making it in New York: arrival, clubs and the scene","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":80,"b":9,"s":"MR. ALBERTSON","x":"And -- then you went with Eddie Heywood. Now this is the Eddie Heywood sextet, in '43, that was Eddie Heywood, Jr., right?"},{"p":80,"b":10,"s":"MR. CHEATHAM","x":"Yes."},{"p":80,"b":11,"s":"MR. ALBERTSON","x":"And you had played with his father?"},{"p":80,"b":12,"s":"MR. CHEATHAM","x":"Yes."},{"p":80,"b":13,"s":"MR. ALBERTSON","x":"Now that seem to have been a long lasting job?"},{"p":80,"b":14,"s":"MR. CHEATHAM","x":"It was."},{"p":80,"b":15,"s":"MR. ALBERTSON","x":"You were there till '45?"},{"p":80,"b":16,"s":"MR. CHEATHAM","x":"Yes, that was a long lasting job."},{"p":80,"b":17,"s":"MR. ALBERTSON","x":"And was this in New York or was this"},{"p":81,"b":0,"s":"MR. ALBERTSON","x":"traveling around."},{"p":81,"b":1,"s":"MR. CHEATHAM","x":"All New York."},{"p":81,"b":2,"s":"MR. ALBERTSON","x":"All in New York?"},{"p":81,"b":3,"s":"MR. CHEATHAM","x":"We didn't go anywhere with that band."},{"p":81,"b":4,"s":"MR. CHEATHAM","x":"Stayed down at Cafe Society."}]}